# What the Mists client loads. The client reads the TOC named for its own game
# in place of ArenaPlus_Data.toc, the same way Details, WeakAuras and Bagnon
# ship theirs, so the Anniversary files are never read here at all.
#
# They were 31 of the addon's 47 MB, measured in Lua 5.1 on the 2026-09-21
# data -- the Anniversary ladders are three times the length of these -- for
# a ladder this client has no use for: its own rating, its own realms and its
# own inspect all come from Mists.
#
# The header above is ArenaPlus_Data.toc's; see the notes there. Publish-Data
# writes the version into every .toc in the folder.
Cutoffs-us.lua
Cutoffs-eu.lua
Leaderboard-us.lua
Leaderboard-eu.lua
Specs-us.lua
Specs-eu.lua
Inspect-us.lua
Inspect-eu.lua
Titles-us.lua
Titles-eu.lua

# Last, as in ArenaPlus_Data.toc: its generator reads the leaderboard.
Activity-us.lua
Activity-eu.lua
